51. `Integration.Experiment.ParameterRegion`,
   `Integration.Experiment.JacobianSensitivity`,
   `Integration.Experiment.ContinuousDynamics`,
   `Integration.Experiment.LithiumContinuous`,
   `Integration.Experiment.ModelReceipts` — the Stage-4 tranche: continuously
