   which the sensitivity is verified to be `∂x/∂θ`, and the payoffs: nonzero
   sensitivity gives local identifiability, zero sensitivity marks a first-order
   blind time, and the computed sensitivity drives the existing selector.
51l. `Integration.Experiment.RepairObligations` — Stage 6, lane 6: the obligation
   a repair must discharge before any search.  The six repair classes; the
   unrestricted repair fits every functionally consistent dataset, is not
   refutable and predicts nothing; hence it cannot inhabit `RepairProposal`,
