   mismatched induced maps, a non-spanning fibre, and separately named actions
   each fail to weld.
51z. `Integration.Variation.SourceCoordinate` — source-coordinate discipline:
   `D²(E ∘ A) = D²E[A', A'] + DE[A'']`, the affine case in which the correction
